{"id":"torrey:presents","source":"torrey","name":"Presents","slug":"presents","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Antiquity of — Ge 32:13; 43:15.","refs":[["Gen",32,13,32,13],["Gen",43,15,43,15]]},{"text":"To judges to secure a favourable hearing. — Pr 17:23; Am 2:6.","refs":[["Prov",17,23,17,23],["Amos",2,6,2,6]]},{"text":"To kings to engage their aid. — 1Ki 15:18.","refs":[["1Kgs",15,18,15,18]]},{"text":"By kings to each other in token of inferiority. — 1Ki 10:25; 2Ch 9:23,24; Ps 72:10.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,25,10,25],["2Chr",9,23,9,23],["2Chr",9,24,9,24],["Ps",72,10,72,10]]},{"text":"To appease the angry feelings of others. — Ge 32:20; 1Sa 25:27,28,35.","refs":[["Gen",32,20,32,20],["1Sam",25,27,25,27],["1Sam",25,28,25,28],["1Sam",25,35,25,35]]},{"text":"To confirm covenants. — Ge 21:28-30.","refs":[["Gen",21,28,21,30]]},{"text":"To reward service. — 2Sa 18:12; Da 2:6,48.","refs":[["2Sam",18,12,18,12],["Dan",2,6,2,6],["Dan",2,48,2,48]]},{"text":"To show respect. — Jdj 6:18.","refs":[["Judg",6,18,6,18]]},{"text":"In token of friendship. — 1Sa 18:3,4.","refs":[["1Sam",18,3,18,3],["1Sam",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"As tribute. — Jdj 3:15; 2Sa 8:2; 2Ch 17:5.","refs":[["Judg",3,15,3,15],["2Sam",8,2,8,2],["2Chr",17,5,17,5]]},{"text":"On occasions of visits. — 2Ki 8:8.","refs":[["2Kgs",8,8,8,8]]},{"text":"On all occasions of public rejoicing. — Ne 8:12; Es 9:19.","refs":[["Neh",8,12,8,12],["Esth",9,19,9,19]]},{"text":"At marriages. — Ge 24:53; Ps 45:12.","refs":[["Gen",24,53,24,53],["Ps",45,12,45,12]]},{"text":"On recovering from sickness. — 2Ki 20:12.","refs":[["2Kgs",20,12,20,12]]},{"text":"On restoration to prosperity. — Job 42:10,11.","refs":[["Job",42,10,42,10],["Job",42,11,42,11]]},{"text":"On sending away friends. — Ge 45:22; Jer 40:5.","refs":[["Gen",45,22,45,22],["Jer",40,5,40,5]]},{"text":"Considered essential on all visits of business — 1Sa 9:7.","refs":[["1Sam",9,7,9,7]]},{"text":"Not bringing, considered a mark of disrespect and disaffection — Isa 10:27; 2Ki 17:24.","refs":[["Isa",10,27,10,27],["2Kgs",17,24,17,24]]},{"text":"Generally procured a favourable reception — Pr 18:16; 19:6.","refs":[["Prov",18,16,18,16],["Prov",19,6,19,6]]},{"text":"When small or defective, refused — Mal 1:8.","refs":[["Mal",1,8,1,8]]},{"text":"Of persons of rank, of great value and variety — 2Ki 5:2; 2Ch 9:1.","refs":[["2Kgs",5,2,5,2],["2Chr",9,1,9,1]]},{"text":"Receiving of, a token of good will — Ge 33:10,11.","refs":[["Gen",33,10,33,10],["Gen",33,11,33,11]]},{"text":"Cattle. — Ge 32:14,15,18.","refs":[["Gen",32,14,32,14],["Gen",32,15,32,15],["Gen",32,18,32,18]]},{"text":"Horses and mules. — 1Ki 10:25.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,25,10,25]]},{"text":"Money. — Ge 45:22; 1Sa 9:8; Job 42:11.","refs":[["Gen",45,22,45,22],["1Sam",9,8,9,8],["Job",42,11,42,11]]},{"text":"Food. — Ge 43:11; 1Sa 25:18; 1Ki 14:3.","refs":[["Gen",43,11,43,11],["1Sam",25,18,25,18],["1Kgs",14,3,14,3]]},{"text":"Garments. — Ge 45:22; 1Sa 18:4.","refs":[["Gen",45,22,45,22],["1Sam",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Weapons of war. — 1Sa 18:4.","refs":[["1Sam",18,4,18,4]]},{"text":"Ornaments. — Ge 24:22,47; Job 42:11.","refs":[["Gen",24,22,24,22],["Gen",24,47,24,47],["Job",42,11,42,11]]},{"text":"Gold and silver vessels. — 1Ki 10:25.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,25,10,25]]},{"text":"Precious stones. — 1Ki 10:2.","refs":[["1Kgs",10,2,10,2]]},{"text":"Servants. — Ge 20:14; 29:24,29.","refs":[["Gen",20,14,20,14],["Gen",29,24,29,24],["Gen",29,29,29,29]]},{"text":"Often borne by servants — Jdj 3:18.","refs":[["Judg",3,18,3,18]]},{"text":"Often conveyed on camels — 1Sa 25:18; 2Ki 8:9; 2Ch 9:1.","refs":[["1Sam",25,18,25,18],["2Kgs",8,9,8,9],["2Chr",9,1,9,1]]},{"text":"Sometimes sent before the giver — Ge 32:21.","refs":[["Gen",32,21,32,21]]},{"text":"Generally presented in person — Ge 43:15,26; Jdj 3:17; 1Sa 25:27.","refs":[["Gen",43,15,43,15],["Gen",43,26,43,26],["Judg",3,17,3,17],["1Sam",25,27,25,27]]},{"text":"Laid out and presented with great ceremony — Ge 43:25; Jdj 3:18; Mt 2:11.","refs":[["Gen",43,25,43,25],["Jud